.TH "YAMLR-SCHEMA" "1" "November 2026" "Yamlr Manual" "User Commands"
\fBCustom Resource Definition (CRD) Schema Management\fR
.PP
The \fByamlr schema\fR command manages and compiles custom Kubernetes schemas and CRD definitions into Yamlr's offline validation cache.
.PP
---
.PP
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
.RS
yamlr schema [ingest|list|clean] [flags]
.RE
.fi
---
.PP
.SH "SUBCOMMANDS"
.SS "1. `ingest`"
Compiles and registers CRD YAML manifests into the local schema cache.
.PP
.nf
.RS
yamlr schema ingest <path> [--out <dir>]
.RE
.fi
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fBpath\fR** *(required)*: Path to a CRD YAML manifest file or directory of CRDs.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--out, -o <DIR>\fR**: Output directory for compiled schema cache. Defaults to \fB.yamlr/schemas\fR.
.SS "2. `list`"
Lists all active custom schemas compiled in the schema cache.
.PP
.nf
.RS
yamlr schema list [--dir <dir>]
.RE
.fi
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--dir <DIR>\fR**: Schema cache directory to inspect. Defaults to \fB.yamlr/schemas\fR.
.SS "3. `clean`"
Clears the local CRD schema cache.
.PP
.nf
.RS
yamlr schema clean [--dir <dir>]
.RE
.fi
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--dir <DIR>\fR**: Schema cache directory to purge. Defaults to \fB.yamlr/schemas\fR.
---
.PP
.SH "EXAMPLES"
.nf
.RS
# Ingest Cert-Manager CRDs into workspace schema cache
yamlr schema ingest ./crds/cert-manager.yaml

# Ingest all CRDs from a directory into .yamlr/schemas
yamlr schema ingest ./manifests/crds/

# List all ingested custom CRD schemas
yamlr schema list

# Clear local CRD schema cache
yamlr schema clean
.RE
.fi
